00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,992
Three point four nanometres.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:10,286
Zero point three four is the gap between neighbouring base pairs, ten of which make a turn, and two nanometres is the width.

3
00:00:10,286 --> 00:00:13,919
Those three numbers are always offered together to catch you.

